The dish is a square plate, roughly 20-22 cm across. It holds about 12-14 cooked carrot slices, cut thick on the diagonal, in a small pile.

Each slice weighs about 8-10 g, so the carrots total roughly 110-130 g. Cooked carrots run about 35-40 kcal per 100 g, which gives about 45-50 kcal. A glaze or butter would add some energy, and the slices look slightly glossy, so I'll allow about 70 kcal in total.

